-- Example: Comments in L4
-- This demonstrates line and block comments

§ `Example: Comments in L4`
    GIVEN age IS A NUMBER  -- inline comment
          name IS A STRING

-- This is a line comment

{- This is a
   multi-line
   block comment -}

GIVETH A NUMBER
`age next year` MEANS age PLUS 1  -- a comment can follow code on any line

#EVAL `age next year` WITH age IS 41
